      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "В рестора́не зака́зчик спра́шивает официа́нта: \"Прошу́ проще́ния, вы зна́ете, какая погода бу́дет за́втра?\"",
      "text_en": "In a restaurant, a customer asked the waiter: \"Excuse me, do you know what the weather will be like tomorrow?\"",
      "ruby": "<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"V\" data-defn=\"в\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">В</span><rt>V</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"restoráne\" data-defn=\"ресторане\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">рестора́не</span><rt>restoráne</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zakázchik\" data-defn=\"заказчик\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зака́зчик</span><rt>zakázchik</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"spráshivaet\" data-defn=\"спрашивает\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">спра́шивает</span><rt>spráshivaet</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ofitsiánta\" data-defn=\"официанта\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">официа́нта</span><rt>ofitsiánta</rt></ruby>: \"<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"Proshú\" data-defn=\"прошу\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">Прошу́</span><rt>Proshú</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"proshchéniya\" data-defn=\"прощения\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">проще́ния</span><rt>proshchéniya</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"vy\" data-defn=\"вы\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">вы</span><rt>vy</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"znáete\" data-defn=\"знаете\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">зна́ете</span><rt>znáete</rt></ruby>, <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"kakaya\" data-defn=\"какая\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">какая</span><rt>kakaya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pogoda\" data-defn=\"погода\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">погода</span><rt>pogoda</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"búdet\" data-defn=\"будет\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">бу́дет</span><rt>búdet</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"závtra\" data-defn=\"завтра\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">за́втра</span><rt>závtra</rt></ruby>?\"",
      "transliteration": "V restoráne zakázchik spráshivaet ofitsiánta: \"Proshú proshchéniya, vy znáete, kakaya pogoda búdet závtra?\"",
      "start": 0.0,
