/span><rt>kakuyu</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"ya\" data-defn=\"я\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">я</span><rt>ya</rt></ruby> <ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"lyublyú\" data-defn=\"люблю\" data-hsk=\"A2\"><span class=\"si\">люблю́</span><rt>lyublyú</rt></ruby>.\"",
